I want to preface this by saying that this isn't meant to be a whole ARG website, I may walk this back in the future
should I be able to come up with a compelling story. Otherwise, these will just be secrets for the sake of secrets.

There is in fact a way to access a secret area of this site, while I am sure that this won't be a subtle hint, just
know that text isn't the only thing that can be clicked on.

I've don't got much else to say, but if you find anything, feel free to say "hello"
